# www app (`@pakfactory/www`)

When editing **`apps/www/`**, follow [`apps/www/CLAUDE.md`](../../CLAUDE.md), repo [`AGENTS.md`](../../../../AGENTS.md), and [`memory.md`](../../memory.md) for ops.

**Quick rules:**

- **Not e-commerce:** no cart/checkout unless explicitly requested — use quote / RFQ / contact CTAs.
- **PR base:** `www-new-release` (rebuild trunk).
- **Auth:** Supabase via `@pakfactory/supabase`; login UI via `@pakfactory/auth-ui` (www owns wiring).
- **Sanity:** queries from `@pakfactory/sanity/queries` only; revalidate via `/api/revalidate`.
- **JSON-LD:** `@pakfactory/seo` only — never inline schema.org objects.
- **UI primitives:** do not edit `packages/ui/src/components` for features; style in app code.
- **ADR-005:** `app/` is routing-only; do not add new `app/_components/` folders (case-studies migration deferred).
- **Staging:** non-production is `noindex`; `staging.pakfactory.com` is Vercel-auth-gated preview.
- **Local dev:** port **3003** (`pnpm dev:www`).
